Package: naomi.zaf
Title: Naomi Model for Subnational HIV Estimates -- South Africa District Estimates version
Version: 2.11.1.999710
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Jeff",
           family = "Eaton",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jeffrey.eaton@imperial.ac.uk",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7728-728X"))
Description: This package implements the Naomi model for subnational HIV estimates. This package is a customised version with additional features for the South Africa district HIV estimates. The version number is suffixed with X.X.X.999710, with 710 reflecting the ISO-3 numeric country code for South Africa.
